OL,3,GNEWSAHandmade poppy display gets 30,000
OL,4,Adonated flowers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Remembrance Day display of handmade
OL,7,Fpoppies has spread across a town after
OL,8,Forganisers received almost double the
OL,9,Fnumber of knitted and crocheted
OL,10,Fdonations they had hoped for.
OL,12,FDurham Markets called for people to put
OL,13,Ftheir needles to work and create 16,386
OL,14,Fpoppies - one for every soldier of the
OL,15,FDurham Light Infantry who died during
OL,16,Fboth World Wars.
OL,18,FAfter amassing more than 30,000 - the
OL,19,Fpoppies adorn The Light art studio and
OL,20,FThe Story museum as well as Market
OL,21,FHall.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
