OL,3,GNEWSAHandmade poppy display gets 30,000
OL,4,Adonated flowers
OL,5,
OL,6,FLouisa McLean from Durham Markets said:
OL,7,F"I wanted to do a project the whole
OL,8,Fcommunity could get involved with, but
OL,9,Fthis went completely viral, with people
OL,10,Fposting them in from across the UK."
